 "notModeled": [
  "analog inputs, VCOM output, test mode TEST[1:0]",
  "the bus is the SPI, TDM fixed-position format (FORMAT[2:0] = 001) on DOUT1 with no CS: each DRDY falling edge starts a 128-bit frame of the channels 1..8 in order; the dynamic-position TDM, discrete (per-channel DOUTn) and frame-sync formats are not modeled, the FORMAT pins are not read, DOUT2..DOUT8 are not driven",
  "daisy-chain: the data shifted in on DIN after the last channel are not passed through (idle 0)",
  "per-channel power-down PWDNn (powered-down channels read zero in the datasheet) and the all-channels-down interface power-down",
  "SYNC pin (filter restart, 129-conversion settling) and the DRDY hold-off after a MODE change",
  "conversion time = 1 / maximum data rate (fCLK = 27 MHz, CLKDIV = 1, Table 4): 52734 SPS high-speed, 10547 SPS low-power; other CLK frequencies and CLKDIV are not modeled; the CLK pin is not used",
  "DRDY returns high on the first SCLK falling edge (modeled as cleared on reading the data); the high pulse before the next conversion when data are not read"
